{"availability":"available","full":"daxtrader54/welt-mesh-demo","name":"welt-mesh-demo","description":"A single-product shoe shop where the checkout runs on Mesh. Next.js, TypeScript, Mesh Link SDK, signed webhooks.","category":"Business","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-04T12:46:23Z","updated":"2026-09-07T17:21:49Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://welt-mesh-demo.vercel.app","topics":["crypto-payments","demo","ecommerce","mesh","meshconnect","nextjs","stablecoin","typescript","usdc","webhooks"],"demo":"https://welt-mesh-demo.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T00:51:05.138Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T00:51:05.138Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T00:51:05.138Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T16:08:27.810Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T02:09:18.703Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T00:51:05.138Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A single-product shoe shop where the checkout runs on Mesh.","You pick a size, add to bag, check out, connect an exchange account, see what you actually hold, choose which stablecoin the merchant is paid in, and pay. Underneath there is a second layer showing what really happened: every Mesh event with its payload, the routes that produced them, and the reasoning behind the whole thing.","The point is not that an API call works. It is that the customer never copied an address, never withdrew anything, and never had to find out what the merchant accepts. Mesh sat in the middle and did it."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/daxtrader54/welt-mesh-demo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6d42fd0208f146ebc6ae44495a2fe8d46640a05182d55f696e9ae21260e0c5c6","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T16:08:28.100Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:08:28.100Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A single-product shoe shop where the checkout runs on Mesh.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/daxtrader54/welt-mesh-demo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"You need a Mesh sandbox Client ID and API key.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/daxtrader54/welt-mesh-demo/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Then POST /api/v1/transfers/managed/configure, which is the only call that answers a question about this account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/daxtrader54/welt-mesh-demo/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Connecting the MeshBTC sandbox account, which holds 5 BTC and no stablecoin at all, and asking configure what can fund a $50 USDC payment returns an empty list.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/daxtrader54/welt-mesh-demo/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"Cost: the demo needs a publicly reachable URL and a registered callback, and sandbox does not guarantee delivery.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/daxtrader54/welt-mesh-demo/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"Tradeoff: a genuinely fresh session needs a new browser profile, which is the right cost for the rarer case.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/daxtrader54/welt-mesh-demo/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Per Mesh's own checklist: register a production webhook URI separately, move to the latest SDK, generate a production API key (which needs 2FA and business verification first), and change MESHAPIBASEURL to Mesh ask for a joint testing session before launch.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/daxtrader54/welt-mesh-demo/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"6d42fd0208f146ebc6ae44495a2fe8d46640a05182d55f696e9ae21260e0c5c6","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/daxtrader54/welt-mesh-demo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:08:28.101Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-07T17:21:49Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://gith